READING
==========================================================================
  If the '% explained' column stays high across the sweep and across
  both estimators, then measurement precision accounts for most of the
  apparent cascade regardless of how detection is defined - which is
  the claim. If it swings with k, the claim is threshold-dependent and
  must be stated as such.
